145
00:07:08,615 --> 00:07:09,515
Nasılsınız?

146
00:07:10,795 --> 00:07:12,595
Muhteşem.

147
00:07:13,275 --> 00:07:13,875
Evet.

148
00:07:13,875 --> 00:07:14,775
